    <briefdescription>
<para>BSP LCD. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file offers API for basic LCD control. It is useful for users who want to use the LCD without the default Graphical Library LVGL.</para>
<para>For standard LCD initialization with LVGL graphical library, you can call all-in-one function <ref refid="group__g04__display_1gae4275824d225d70a382b86178f39450c" kindref="member">bsp_display_start()</ref>. </para>
